<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hu">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>{{title}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">
	<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f5f5f5;">
		<tr>
			<td style="padding: 24px 12px;">
				<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="600" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
					<tr>
						<td style="background-color: #1f2937; padding: 18px 24px;">
							<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff;">{{title}}</h1>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding: 28px 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #374151;">
							{{{body}}}
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="background-color: #f9fafb; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 16px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">
							Ez egy automatikus üzenet, kérjük, ne válaszoljon rá.
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
</body>
</html>
